ode": 401, "parameters": ["cap. I guess I'm a merrow now..."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset11", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yep! You're a real cutie pie!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Um...\\.thank you."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset11", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'm sure you'll lose that hat soon "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["enough looking like that!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 411, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ah, what happened to me?\\. Oh no!\\. I'm "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["still a girl!\\. Wait,\\. why do my legs feel "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["funny?\\. Oh my god,\\. am I a mermaid?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 213, "parameters": [14, 4, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset11", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No silly!\\. You're a merrow! I'm a mermaid!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Wait,\\. how can you tell?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset11", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Because you've got such a cute little "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["beret on!\\. Of course it's lucky you're "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["not married,\\. otherwise I wouldn't be "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["able to tell at all!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [-1, 2, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What do you mean?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset11", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Geez, you really don't know anything do you?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Everyone knows Merrows only ever give up"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["their hat when they get married!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Right,\\. well I think I'll be holding on to it for "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["a little while longer then.\\..\\.."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [14, 4, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset11", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ooh! Saving yourself for that 'special "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["someone' are you?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [-1, 5, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{\\{\\{NO."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Anyway,\\. how am I supposed to get back to"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["being human.\\. And male."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [14, 2, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset11", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Human?\\..\\..\\..Oh I get it!\\. It was a joke,\\. ha!\\. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You're so funny!\\. Oh by the way,\\.\\. who are"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you again?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [-1, 6, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Eugh, this chick is weird.\\..\\..But it looks "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["like I'm stuck here, at least for a "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["while.\\. I should probably try to just "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["fit in.\\..\\.."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Before you dive toward the Mermaid's city,"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you take your first proper look at yourself "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["in the deep blue of the ocean's waters."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 223, "parameters": [[255, 255, 255, 0], 60, true]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Merrow2", 0, 0, 250, 0, 20, 20, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [2, "Merrow1", 0, 0, -50, 0, 60, 60, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset19", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I suppose I'm going to have to get used "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to this body for a while,\\. it can't be "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["that bad though.\\. At least I'm pretty hot."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 235, "parameters": [2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 223, "parameters": [[255, 255, 255, 0], 180, true]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["While you never do find a way back to your human "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["form, you do end up living happily for the rest of"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["your life as a beautiful Merrow."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Eventually you settle into the merfolk society"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["and begin to act more and more like your new kin.\\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Before long you've already found yourself a husband,"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["even though you were initially against the idea."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 223, "parameters": [[255, 255, 255, 0], 60, true]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Merrow3", 0, 0, 170, 0, 70, 70, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["While swimming just beneath the water surface one"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["peaceful night, you became snagged in the net of"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["a young fisherman.\\. As he pulled you up out of the "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["water he instantly became entranced by your beauty."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Merrow4", 0, 0, 75, -20, 50, 50, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["While at first you were wary, after talking with "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["him for the rest of the night you slowly began to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["warm to him. Even after he let you go you kept "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["coming back to talk with him every night."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["It wasn't long after that before he propsed to you."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["While remnants of your male mind still opposed the"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["idea the rest of you was overwhelmed with powerful"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["emotions of joy and love,\\. you instantly accepted."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["With help from one of the nearby Sea Bishops he was"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["granted a life under the waves and the two of you "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["were wedded.\\. As you finally took off your hat the "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["last bits of your male mind were transformed."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Merrow5", 0, 0, -25, 0, 59, 59, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["As the two of you set off on your honeymoon it"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["became the first of many nights as a true Merrow."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 2, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": [""]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{\\{\\{ Ending B3 - 'Under da Sea'"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 121, "parameters": [909, 909, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 355, "parameters": ["global_save"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 353, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 3, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 1, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 3, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "Mermaids2", "characterIndex": 7, "direction": 6, "pattern": 1}}]}, {"id": 15, "name": "Sun Rays", "x": 0, "y": 0, "pages": [{"conditions": {"switch1Valid": false, "switch2Valid": false, "variableValid": false, "selfSwitchValid": false, "itemValid": false, "actorValid": false, 